        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International PH-4861, Traditional Door Pull With Petal Ends</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPerfect for appliances as well as for use on doors where a through bolt pull can be used, the Rustic Ridged Door Pull really catches the highlights of the 7 available finishes. A simple door handle, it has subtle petal shapes at the ends. Made by RK International, the Lined Rod with Petals at End has a 12 inch center to center.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/rustic-ridged-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-859\"><b>Rustic Ridged Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the PH-4861 12 Inch Lined Rod with Petals at Ends:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 15-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR50_size.gif?v=1704354712\" width=\"586\" height=\"116\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
